chapter AFP

session Datalog_Certification = Grounding_Utils +
  description \<open>Certified models of positive datalog programs: a generic, PDDL-free checker
    for Nemo-style ordered-graph certificates, proven exact against the least-model
    semantics (dl_derivable) of the program, plus a generic forward-chaining evaluator
    (Datalog_Evaluation) that computes a candidate model for the checker to validate. Built on the
    light Grounding_Utils heap (no PDDL semantics, no Collections/ODE tower), so the
    datalog/graph branch stays free of the AFP Collections code-gen tower that the graph library
    conflicts with.\<close>
  options [timeout = 600]
  sessions
    "HOL-Data_Structures"
    "Stratified_Datalog"
  theories
    Datalog_Sema_Supplement
    Datalog_Certificate
    Datalog_Certificate_Code
    Fact_Index
    Datalog_Evaluation
    Tree_Decomposition
